 ### 0245 — VPN lifecycle separates ownership, enablement, system state, and runtime capability (TASK-260715-1q4qhw)
 - DECISION: A manager is owned only when its protocol is `NETunnelProviderProtocol`, its provider bundle ID exactly matches the accepted platform binding, and its stable provider-configuration marker matches. Labels, server address, enabled state, profile UUID, schema version, and array order never establish ownership. Every write/remove rechecks a freshly loaded object; unmarked lookalikes and duplicates are zero-write conflicts outside explicit inactive duplicate repair.
